<type>(<scope>): <subject>

# Body: explain what and why, not how; wrap at 72 chars
#
# Footer examples:
# Fixes #123
# BREAKING CHANGE: ...
# Co-authored-by: User <user@example.com>
#
# Valid types:
#   feat     new feature
#   fix      bug fix
#   docs     documentation
#   style    formatting
#   refactor refactor code
#   perf     performance
#   test     tests
#   build    build/deps
#   ci       CI config
#   chore    maintenance
#   revert   revert commit
#
# Scope: optional, omit parentheses if not applicable
# Subject: imperative, max 50 chars, no trailing period
